          "settings": {
            "title": "Product Details & How To Use",
            "body": "<p>Apply an even layer to clean, dry skin — avoiding the eye area, eyebrows, hairline, and lips. Leave on until the layer looks matte, not tacky (roughly 15–20 minutes), then peel from the edges in one motion.<br/>Use 1–2 times per week as part of your evening routine.<br/>Follow with your usual moisturizer to lock in hydration.</p>"
          }
        },
